{
  "snp2.12:0.1": "",
  "snp2.12:0.2": "12. Nigrodhakappasuttaṃ ",
  "snp2.12:1.1": "Evaṃ me sutaṃ – ",
  "snp2.12:1.2": "ekaṃ samayaṃ bhagavā āḷaviyaṃ viharati aggāḷave cetiye. ",
  "snp2.12:1.3": "Tena kho pana samayena āyasmato vaṅgīsassa upajjhāyo nigrodhakappo nāma thero aggāḷave cetiye aciraparinibbuto hoti. ",
  "snp2.12:1.4": "Atha kho āyasmato vaṅgīsassa rahogatassa paṭisallīnassa evaṃ cetaso parivitakko udapādi – ",
  "snp2.12:1.5": "‘‘parinibbuto nu kho me upajjhāyo udāhu no parinibbuto’’ti? ",
  "snp2.12:1.6": "Atha kho āyasmā vaṅgīso sāyanhasamayaṃ paṭisallānā vuṭṭhito yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṃ abhivādetvā ekamantaṃ nisīdi. Ekamantaṃ nisinno kho āyasmā vaṅgīso bhagavantaṃ etadavoca – ",
  "snp2.12:1.7": "‘‘idha mayhaṃ, bhante, rahogatassa paṭisallīnassa evaṃ cetaso parivitakko udapādi – ",
  "snp2.12:1.8": "‘parinibbuto nu kho me upajjhāyo, udāhu no parinabbuto’’’ti. ",
  "snp2.12:1.9": "Atha kho āyasmā vaṅgīso uṭṭhāyāsanā ekaṃsaṃ cīvaraṃ katvā yena bhagavā tenañjaliṃ paṇāmetvā bhagavantaṃ gāthāya ajjhabhāsi – ",
  "snp2.12:2.1": "345. ‘‘Pucchāma satthāramanomapaññaṃ, ",
  "snp2.12:2.2": "diṭṭheva dhamme yo vicikicchānaṃ chettā; ",
  "snp2.12:2.3": "Aggāḷave kālamakāsi bhikkhu, ",
  "snp2.12:2.4": "ñāto yasassī abhinibbutatto. ",
  "snp2.12:3.1": "346. ‘‘Nigrodhakappo iti tassa nāmaṃ, ",
  "snp2.12:3.2": "tayā kataṃ bhagavā brāhmaṇassa; ",
  "snp2.12:3.3": "So taṃ namassaṃ acari mutyapekkho, ",
  "snp2.12:3.4": "āraddhavīriyo daḷhadhammadassī. ",
  "snp2.12:4.1": "347. ‘‘Taṃ sāvakaṃ sakya mayampi sabbe, ",
  "snp2.12:4.2": "aññātumicchāma samantacakkhu; ",
  "snp2.12:4.3": "Samavaṭṭhitā no savanāya sotā, ",
  "snp2.12:4.4": "tuvaṃ no satthā tvamanuttarosi. ",
  "snp2.12:5.1": "348. ‘‘Chindeva no vicikicchaṃ brūhi metaṃ, ",
  "snp2.12:5.2": "parinibbutaṃ vedaya bhūripañña; ",
  "snp2.12:5.3": "Majjheva no bhāsa samantacakkhu, ",
  "snp2.12:5.4": "sakkova devāna sahassanetto. ",
  "snp2.12:6.1": "349. ‘‘Ye keci ganthā idha mohamaggā, ",
  "snp2.12:6.2": "aññāṇapakkhā vicikicchaṭhānā; ",
  "snp2.12:6.3": "Tathāgataṃ patvā na te bhavanti, ",
  "snp2.12:6.4": "cakkhuñhi etaṃ paramaṃ narānaṃ. ",
  "snp2.12:7.1": "350. ‘‘No ce hi jātu puriso kilese, ",
  "snp2.12:7.2": "vāto yathā abbhadhanaṃ vihāne; ",
  "snp2.12:7.3": "Tamovassa nivuto sabbaloko, ",
  "snp2.12:7.4": "na jotimantopi narā tapeyyuṃ. ",
  "snp2.12:8.1": "351. ‘‘Dhīrā ca pajjotakarā bhavanti, ",
  "snp2.12:8.2": "taṃ taṃ ahaṃ vīra tatheva maññe; ",
  "snp2.12:8.3": "Vipassinaṃ jānamupāgamumhā , ",
  "snp2.12:8.4": "parisāsu no āvikarohi kappaṃ. ",
  "snp2.12:9.1": "352. ‘‘Khippaṃ giraṃ eraya vaggu vagguṃ, ",
  "snp2.12:9.2": "haṃsova paggayha saṇikaṃ nikūja; ",
  "snp2.12:9.3": "Bindussarena suvikappitena, ",
  "snp2.12:9.4": "sabbeva te ujjugatā suṇoma. ",
  "snp2.12:10.1": "353. ‘‘Pahīnajātimaraṇaṃ asesaṃ, ",
  "snp2.12:10.2": "niggayha dhonaṃ vadessāmi dhammaṃ; ",
  "snp2.12:10.3": "Na kāmakāro hi puthujjanānaṃ, ",
  "snp2.12:10.4": "saṅkheyyakāro ca tathāgatānaṃ. ",
  "snp2.12:11.1": "354. ‘‘Sampannaveyyākaraṇaṃ tavedaṃ, ",
  "snp2.12:11.2": "samujjupaññassa samuggahītaṃ; ",
  "snp2.12:11.3": "Ayamañjalī pacchimo suppaṇāmito, ",
  "snp2.12:11.4": "mā mohayī jānamanomapañña. ",
  "snp2.12:12.1": "355. ‘‘Parovaraṃ ariyadhammaṃ viditvā, ",
  "snp2.12:12.2": "mā mohayī jānamanomavīra; ",
  "snp2.12:12.3": "Vāriṃ yathā ghammani ghammatatto, ",
  "snp2.12:12.4": "vācābhikaṅkhāmi sutaṃ pavassa . ",
  "snp2.12:13.1": "356. ‘‘Yadatthikaṃ brahmacariyaṃ acarī, ",
  "snp2.12:13.2": "kappāyano kaccissa taṃ amoghaṃ; ",
  "snp2.12:13.3": "Nibbāyi so ādu saupādiseso, ",
  "snp2.12:13.4": "yathā vimutto ahu taṃ suṇoma’’. ",
  "snp2.12:14.1": "357. ‘‘Acchecchi taṇhaṃ idha nāmarūpe, ",
  "snp2.12:14.2": "(iti bhagavā) ",
  "snp2.12:14.3": "Kaṇhassa sotaṃ dīgharattānusayitaṃ; ",
  "snp2.12:14.4": "Atāri jātiṃ maraṇaṃ asesaṃ,’’ ",
  "snp2.12:14.5": "Iccabravī bhagavā pañcaseṭṭho. ",
  "snp2.12:15.1": "358. ‘‘Esa sutvā pasīdāmi, ",
  "snp2.12:15.2": "vaco te isisattama; ",
  "snp2.12:15.3": "Amoghaṃ kira me puṭṭhaṃ, ",
  "snp2.12:15.4": "na maṃ vañcesi brāhmaṇo. ",
  "snp2.12:16.1": "359. ‘‘Yathāvādī tathākārī, ",
  "snp2.12:16.2": "ahu buddhassa sāvako; ",
  "snp2.12:16.3": "Acchidā maccuno jālaṃ, ",
  "snp2.12:16.4": "tataṃ māyāvino daḷhaṃ. ",
  "snp2.12:17.1": "360. ‘‘Addasā bhagavā ādiṃ, ",
  "snp2.12:17.2": "upādānassa kappiyo; ",
  "snp2.12:17.3": "Accagā vata kappāyano, ",
  "snp2.12:17.4": "maccudheyyaṃ suduttara’’nti. ",
  "snp2.12:17.5": "Nigrodhakappasuttaṃ dvādasamaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ. "
}
